          ("Oxidative killing of ingested bacteria inside phagosomes", "This is impaired in chronic granulomatous disease, which has an abnormal oxidative-burst assay; the assay is normal here."),
          ("Fusion of lysosomal granules with pathogen-containing phagosomes", "A granule-trafficking defect suggests Chediak-Higashi syndrome, usually with giant granules and partial albinism, absent here."),
